(7595913, 1225566, 173844, '<td valign="top">A truly lovely image with an immaculately narrow depth of field.  What absolutely wins me over is the tremulous, yearning quality of the front petals.  A gesture of true emotion.  The background melts naturally away.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'A truly lovely image with an immaculately narrow depth of field.  What absolutely wins me over is the tremulous, yearning quality of the front petals.  A gesture of true emotion.  The background melts naturally away.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2018-09-11 22:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
