(7595940, 1225613, 173844, '<td valign="top">Spot on title for this almost psychedelic ambiguous mask of a peony.  The hyper-realism and beautifully delineated tones and shapes lift this onto a higher plane.  Can''t get a real grip on what seems to be a face, but the effort is tantalizing.  Brilliantly realized.</td>', 'Spot on title for this almost psychedelic ambiguous mask of a peony.  The hyper-realism and beautifully delineated tones and shapes lift this onto a higher plane.  Can''t get a real grip on what seems to be a face, but the effort is tantalizing.  Brilliantly realized.', '2018-09-12 00:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7595941, 1225714, 173844, '<td valign="top">I admire this tender portrait of a plant on the far side of blossoming, no longer flush with the pride of youth.  It really pays to notice the entire span of life, and not flinch at decline, which has its own strength and beauty.  The background bokeh is lovely.  The design of the plant is elegant and the composition is simple and appropriate.  The spider web strand is a bonus.</td>', 'I admire this tender portrait of a plant on the far side of blossoming, no longer flush with the pride of youth.  It really pays to notice the entire span of life, and not flinch at decline, which has its own strength and beauty.  The background bokeh is lovely.  The design of the plant is elegant and the composition is simple and appropriate.  The spider web strand is a bonus.', '2018-09-12 00:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7595943, 1225658, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very pretty waterscape with a tree of character.  The pleasant tracery of it, and the reflection that blends into the ripples and stones, bespeak patience and determination.  The rest of the scene is calm and reassuring.  I like the way the fog is coming in from the left.  The delicately marbled sky wraps up this excellent image.  A high key dream.</td>', 'Very pretty waterscape with a tree of character.  The pleasant tracery of it, and the reflection that blends into the ripples and stones, bespeak patience and determination.  The rest of the scene is calm and reassuring.  I like the way the fog is coming in from the left.  The delicately marbled sky wraps up this excellent image.  A high key dream.', '2018-09-12 00:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7595947, 1225738, 104230, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! (not voting)</td>', 'Gorgeous! (not voting)', '2018-09-12 00:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7595950, 1225720, 173844, '<td valign="top">Pretty, softly focused image.  Natural or processed, it''s the result that we''re interested in.  It reminds me of those little pods that are dropped into water and open up into paper flowers.  Aside from the flowers, the darks and lights settle into somewhat abstract patterns, furthering the under water sensation.  Very nice.</td>', 'Pretty, softly focused image.  Natural or processed, it''s the result that we''re interested in.  It reminds me of those little pods that are dropped into water and open up into paper flowers.  Aside from the flowers, the darks and lights settle into somewhat abstract patterns, furthering the under water sensation.  Very nice.', '2018-09-12 00:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7595951, 1225753, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsome spray of leaves lit well to bring out contrast, tones and texture.  It floats out there on its own, inviting inspection and exploration.  How to get the most out of what, at first glance, may seem unpromising.</td>', 'Handsome spray of leaves lit well to bring out contrast, tones and texture.  It floats out there on its own, inviting inspection and exploration.  How to get the most out of what, at first glance, may seem unpromising.', '2018-09-12 00:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7595952, 1225751, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a handsome plant, its leaves flying like pennants and its pods held out, beseeching the sky.  It is mighty and majestic in its setting.  Fine perspective, looking up and out over an expanse of water.  Nice focus all the way through.  Stirring image.</td>', 'What a handsome plant, its leaves flying like pennants and its pods held out, beseeching the sky.  It is mighty and majestic in its setting.  Fine perspective, looking up and out over an expanse of water.  Nice focus all the way through.  Stirring image.', '2018-09-12 00:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7595953, 1225587, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beguiling inner view, that secret life, of this plant.  The arcing lines, like ribs sprung from a spine, create a strong, rhythmic pattern.  The focus also accentuates line and form.  Has a feel of batik.  Subtly powerful.</td>', 'Beguiling inner view, that secret life, of this plant.  The arcing lines, like ribs sprung from a spine, create a strong, rhythmic pattern.  The focus also accentuates line and form.  Has a feel of batik.  Subtly powerful.', '2018-09-12 00:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7595958, 1225675, 173844, '<td valign="top">Presented as a lovely illustration in a book of flowers.  Fine composition and  tones.  Deftly handled in an assured manner.  Handsome.</td>', 'Presented as a lovely illustration in a book of flowers.  Fine composition and  tones.  Deftly handled in an assured manner.  Handsome.', '2018-09-12 00:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
