(7595976, 1225730, 173844, '<td valign="top">Rollover obliterated my comment, so I''ll try to reconstruct it.<br/>I really like this seeming hodge-podge, this crowded corner of the garden.  The husky vine, if that''s what it is, seems to be a figure leaning over to tend its long-leaved charge.  The light brings out strong reliefs (no pun intended).  There is both an earnest and a chuckling aspect to this tableau.  It makes me smile.</td>', 'Rollover obliterated my comment, so I''ll try to reconstruct it.I really like this seeming hodge-podge, this crowded corner of the garden.  The husky vine, if that''s what it is, seems to be a figure leaning over to tend its long-leaved charge.  The light brings out strong reliefs (no pun intended).  There is both an earnest and a chuckling aspect to this tableau.  It makes me smile.', '2018-09-12 01:12:14.000000', NULL, 0),
